# Stegron's "Dinosaur Formula - {1}{R}, Discard this card: Until end of turn, target creature you control gets +3/+1 and becomes a Dinosaur in
# addition to its other types", from the hand. With only Mox Emerald's {G} and Mox Jet's {B} in the pool it is refused: the {R} is pinned.
# With Mox Ruby added it is paid, and it refuses Bot2 (a player), a Mox (not a creature) and takes Bot1's Ornithopter (0/2 Thopter): it is a
# 3/3 Dinosaur Thopter (Stegron in the graveyard) until Bot2's turn 2, where it is back to 0/2 and a Thopter only.

